  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"e8debe1a-1867-47a1-a45f-21595bd4a4e1\">\n  <p class=\"poem\">The first is to conquer the world<br>\n  through force and coercion<br>\n  and rule the world as a tyrant.</p>\n  <p class=\"poem\">The other is to create a world so small<br>\n  that you remove all competition.</p>\n  <p class=\"poem\">In the end, both are just as destructive<br>\n  to the people around them.</p>\n</article>\n",
